{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"সুনান আন-নাসায়ী","section":{"48":"The Book of Adornment"},"section_detail":{"48":{"hadithnumber_first":5040,"hadithnumber_last":5378,"arabicnumber_first":5040,"arabicnumber_last":5378,"name_native":"অলঙ্করণ বই"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":5235,"arabicnumber":5235,"text":"মুমাহহাদ ইবন মা'মার (রহঃ) ... আনাস (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত যে, নবী সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম এর মাথার চুল উভয় কাঁধ ছুঁতো।","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":48,"hadith":196}}]}